goldenland-realestate-v2 AI Assist test/workflow quirks: (1) Call `aiAssistAdminUser()` exactly once per test — a second call registers another Gate::before that denies other users. (2) Spatie caches getMedia per model instance; deleted media stays in the cached collection — use a fresh model instance after media deletion. (3) Filament fillForm/mergeState merges list state element-wise — checkbox arrays need a direct set(). (4) Assert notification bodies via Notification instance assertions. (5) Review-modal evidence holds in component state but isn't rendered server-side into modal HTML — assert on state, not HTML. (6) New agent fakes (e.g. webSearchFake()) must be installed in every test setup where generate() runs, or the real agent runs and causes unexpected errors. <!-- created=2026-08-07, last=2026-08-07 -->
